  "description": "Bring Joy and Fun to Every Design with Candy Patch!\nMake your creative projects sparkle with Candy Patch, a bold, whimsical bubble font designed especially for little ones. Featuring soft, rounded edges and charming stitched line details within each letter, this font perfectly captures the innocence and fun of childhood.\nCandy Patch is a must-have font for crafters, teachers, and small business owners. Its bold silhouette makes it highly legible, while the embroidery-inspired dotted lines add a handmade touch that looks stunning on everything from nursery decor to school supplies.\nWhy Candy Patch is Perfect for Your Shop:\nUnique Stitch Detail: The built-in dotted lines provide a “stitched” look that’s perfect for fabric-based designs and DIY crafts.\nOptimized for Crafters: The clean, smooth outline ensures perfect cuts every time on your Cricut, Silhouette, or Brother ScanNCut.\nHighly Readable: Its bold, heavy weight makes it ideal for titles, headlines, and elementary school educational materials. Versatile Style: Perfect for bright, colorful designs as well as clean, minimalist black-and-white layouts.\nIdeal For:\nBaby & Toddler Nursery Decor: Personalized wall art, name tags, and growth charts.\nKids’ Apparel: Adorable t-shirts, baby clothes, and custom hoodies.\nSchool & Education: Class posters, teacher worksheets, and student name tags.\nCelebrations: Birthday invitations, cake toppers, and party banners.\nMerchandise: Stickers, tote bags, mugs, and sublimated tumblers.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bring Joy and Fun to Every Design with Candy Patch!</p>\n<p>Make your creative projects sparkle with Candy Patch, a bold, whimsical bubble font designed especially for little ones. Featuring soft, rounded edges and charming stitched line details within each letter, this font perfectly captures the innocence and fun of childhood.</p>\n<p>Candy Patch is a must-have font for crafters, teachers, and small business owners. Its bold silhouette makes it highly legible, while the embroidery-inspired dotted lines add a handmade touch that looks stunning on everything from nursery decor to school supplies.</p>\n<p>Why Candy Patch is Perfect for Your Shop:<br>\nUnique Stitch Detail: The built-in dotted lines provide a “stitched” look that’s perfect for fabric-based designs and DIY crafts.<br>\nOptimized for Crafters: The clean, smooth outline ensures perfect cuts every time on your Cricut, Silhouette, or Brother ScanNCut.<br>\nHighly Readable: Its bold, heavy weight makes it ideal for titles, headlines, and elementary school educational materials. Versatile Style: Perfect for bright, colorful designs as well as clean, minimalist black-and-white layouts.</p>\n<p>Ideal For:<br>\nBaby &amp; Toddler Nursery Decor: Personalized wall art, name tags, and growth charts.</p>\n<p>Kids’ Apparel: Adorable t-shirts, baby clothes, and custom hoodies.</p>\n<p>School &amp; Education: Class posters, teacher worksheets, and student name tags.</p>\n<p>Celebrations: Birthday invitations, cake toppers, and party banners.</p>\n<p>Merchandise: Stickers, tote bags, mugs, and sublimated tumblers.</p>",
